WEBVTT

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:09.100
Today's lesson will be a discussion
about a certain problem.

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:14.340
I would like you candidates for the throne
to answer as though you are king.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.810
Let us begin.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.780
I have some beautiful Venice lace here.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.840
The sole specialty store in the
kingdom that makes this lace

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.700
needs to be replaced due
to the building's age.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.840
However, the proprietor does
not have the funds for it.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.830
So, they have come to ask the state for
a loan to finance the construction.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.830
As king, how would you answer?

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.370
Hmm... I'd lend them the money.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.080
Sounds like it wouldn't be much, anyway.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.350
No, you cannot do that.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:41.720
Why not?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.640
By law, the state cannot give financial
loans to private citizens.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.500
That is correct.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.840
Then why don't they all solve it together?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.820
The townspeople could save up a little
money each month, pool it together,

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.990
and lend it out when someone needs it.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.290
I can only get one torte per day,
so sometimes I save them up for ten days

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.730
so I can eat them all at once.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.790
It would be like that, right?

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.030
That's our Leo and his crazy imagination.

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.950
Oh, no. I think it's a good idea.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.770
Father?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:17.850
In fact, insurance systems have already
caught on in our neighboring countries.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:22.170
It might be time for Glanzreich
to consider such a system, as well.

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:25.880
Leonhard, I'm of a mind to present
this opinion to the council.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.350
Will you put together a report for me?

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.640
H-Huh?

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.480
Bravo, Your Highness. You have
earned your father's praise.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.020
Huh?

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.020
Amazing, Leonhard.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.360
Congratulations.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.340
Bruno... I did it...

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.240
I got lots of praise!

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:46.110
Thanks!

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.980
All of a sudden, those childhood
memories are rushing back...

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.740
When I was small,
I loved watching Father work.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.430
The Whereabouts of a Dream

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.830
Here again, Bruno?

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.140
I'm sorry. Excuse me!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.810
You can join me for a little bit.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.980
Huh? I really may?!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.600
Yes. Come here.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.830
Would you read this to me?

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.730
Yes! May I?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.750
Father's so amazing.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.690
So this is the kind of
work he does every day.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.340
This was the moment that made me want
to become a great king like Father

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.000
when I grew up.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:03.530
Prince Eins, the eldest,
is incredible. A true genius.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:08.500
I heard he was studying at a
seventeen-year-old level at the age of ten.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.340
He's top of his class at military academy,
he excels in literary <i>and</i> military arts...

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.480
He does say confounding things sometimes,

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:18.480
but he has an incredible imagination,
persuasive powers, charm...

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.830
He'll be the next king.
There's no doubting that.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.350
No way...

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.600
I have to study more. I have to beat Eins.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.420
I don't believe in geniuses!

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.990
I started studying as though
my life depended on it.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.880
Others began to praise me.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:45.010
Yet the assumption that Eins would
be the next king did not change.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:51.390
Every time, I wonder...
If there is such a thing as geniuses,

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.440
will any amount of my effort
actually mean anything?

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:59.530
Even if I did catch up to my "genius" brother,
I'd only be called a "genius," too.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.310
I never noticed it before, but Leonhard...

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:08.610
If you are a born genius
like Eins, then I...

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.200
Prince Bruno.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.840
Is everything all right?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:13.440
Master...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.030
Do you feel unwell?

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.030
No, it's not that.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.830
No? You did not seem yourself.
I was concerned.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.500
Concerned?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.590
I-I made you—

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.320
My sincerest apologies!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:31.220
How could I trouble my master
in any way? I despise myself!

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.840
Come now. It's fine. Lift your head.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.470
Forgive me.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.480
Now, regarding this piece of writing.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.230
How was it?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.070
I'm to present it at an academic conference
two weeks from now, at university.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.480
Oh? Your Highness, you attend university?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.910
N-No, not officially.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:56.080
I visited the university when I
heard that a scholar I respect,

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.790
Dr. Dmitri of Orosz,
would give a lecture there.

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:04.910
Unfortunately, his schedule
changed and it was canceled.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:10.760
But I've been receiving private guidance from
the university professors I met at that time.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.090
My, my.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:18.640
It is only to broaden my horizons.
Your lessons are more important to me, of course.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.410
You are my one and only master!

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:23.050
Ah... Thank you?

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.100
He didn't need to clarify so insistently...

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:30.380
My current paper has a difficult theme.
I welcome your frank advice.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.030
Then in my frank opinion...

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.900
It is incomplete overall.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:39.510
Regarding ethnic issues,
you merely rehash previous papers.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.250
There is no new point of view here.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.290
Also, the frequent misspellings are jarring.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.620
I marked them for you.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:45.950
Huh?!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.400
Th-This is shameful...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.040
Prince Bruno. Have you been anxious lately?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.720
You are not yourself. Did anything happen?

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.710
I-I... Well...

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.970
I will not force you to tell me.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.880
I understand that something
is distracting you.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:08.460
Be that as it may,
you need to concentrate on this paper.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:09.990
I'm embarrassed...

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.980
Let us do this, then.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.580
You will complete this
paper and show it to me

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.750
before your presentation in two weeks' time.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:23.040
Think through what kind of kingdom
you hope to create in the future.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:26.710
And, if I am not satisfied
with your paper...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.750
I will release you from being my apprentice.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.390
Frown

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.390
Although I do not remember ever taking you
on as my apprentice in the first place.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:36.390
It's the first time...

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.890
The very first time you've
called me your apprentice!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.270
To think you had such high hopes for me...

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:47.010
If I were struck dead at this very moment,
I would have no regrets!

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:51.630
Wait, no. First, I must complete this paper.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.960
Just you wait, Master!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.820
I swear I shall not let you down!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.340
All right! I can do this!

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:01.320
Well, as long as he is motivated...

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.210
Do your best, Prince Bruno.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.420
Forget about the throne for now.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.390
I'll focus on the task at hand,
and work as hard as I can.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.370
This is no good.

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.570
This isn't right, either.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.520
That's it!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:34.610
I need to give exhaustive consideration to
my ideal future kingdom, as Master said!

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.960
Good morning, Father!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.920
Good morning, Leonhard.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:59.880
U-Um, I know it's not great,
but I did put together my opinion.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.640
I see. I look forward to reading it.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.630
Yes, sir!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.140
It is the day of truth, Prince Bruno.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.270
M-Master...

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.110
Your Highness! You look wretched.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.170
Forgive my unsightly appearance.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.950
Master. With this paper, I will prove I
am an apprentice you can be proud of.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.320
Oh? You seem quite confident.

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.580
No... Frankly, I am not.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:30.130
But I can say with certainty
that I did the best I could.

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.620
I will have a look, then.

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:37.960
A-Ahem...

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.970
How was it?

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:42.670
Excellent.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.560
Frankly, it exceeded my expectations.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.190
Your thoughts are deeper than before,

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.440
and your examination from diverse viewpoints
taught me a few things as well.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.440
Y-You learned from me?

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.940
Indeed. Present your paper proudly.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.690
I am proud to call you my apprentice.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.550
Of course, it is practically
synonymous with student.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:09.960
So, if you would call me "professor"
from now on as everyone does—

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:09.960
Master!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.570
Thank you very much!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.830
Your apprentice will not embarrass you!

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:20.290
Goodness gracious.
He is completely back to normal.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:28.210
I'm still nervous to take the stage.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.810
Please prepare yourself.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.140
Of course.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:37.430
My genius of a brother, Eins,
would be confident even now, wouldn't he?

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.510
I realized something a long time ago.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:45.610
If not for my title as the third prince,
I would be an ordinary man, born with nothing.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.790
That is why I must expend tens of
times more effort than others,

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.370
or I will never become someone
special enough to inspire others.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.870
But for now, as a prince...

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.000
As Master's apprentice...

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.550
I must not embarrass myself.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:05.090
Will that not become
necessary to our kingdom?

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:07.970
That is all. Thank you for your attention.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:16.610
Is an ordinary man like me
not enough, after all?

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.600
I need to be a genius like Eins in order to...

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.200
Thank God. Thank God...

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.320
I did it!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.200
That was an excellent paper, Prince Bruno.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.470
Your Highness, would you give
a lecture at my university?

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.600
Thank you.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:51.600
One at a time, please.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.650
Not to be rude, but who might you be?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.470
Well, what a pleasure to meet you, Bruno!

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.810
You're quite the looker
up close, aren't you?

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:05.170
Forgive me, but who are you?

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:05.770
Huh?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.850
Your hair, doctor.
And your glasses are crooked.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.720
Oh, whoops!

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:14.190
Now, that's strange.
I'd heard you were a fan of mine.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:17.090
C-Could you be... Dr. Dmitri of Orosz?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:21.120
That's me! And this is my
assistant Smerdyakov. Hello!

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.840
Oof, I wouldn't want to be a strange old man

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.010
saying complete strangers are my fans...

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:33.600
I can't believe I'm meeting the
great Dr. Dmitri like this.

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.950
Staring at Dr. Dmitri? How rude.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:38.810
Now, now...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.790
I heard all about you from
an acquaintance of mine.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.460
I was intrigued, so I came out
here to hear your presentation.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.590
Y-You came just for me?

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:49.190
Mmhmm, and it was fabulous.

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.660
How would you like to have dinner?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.690
Yes, absolutely!

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:58.790
So, Bruno— Ah, is it all right
if I don't call you Prince Bruno?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.690
I'm not one of your subjects,
and I'm not here to talk politics, either.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:05.190
I do not mind.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.830
Then I won't hesitate.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:12.440
Actually, I've had the privilege
of reading several of your papers.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:15.020
I think highly of you.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.320
Thank you.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.940
So, I have a proposal.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:23.810
How would you feel about leaving Glanzreich
and studying to be a scholar with me?

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.780
Huh?

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.600
Prince Bruno is out quite late.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.760
I'm sure he is safe with
the guards, but it is odd.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.370
Prince Bruno...

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.380
Prince...?

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:46.220
Prince Bruno returned quite
late today, didn't he?

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.730
Pleased to make your acquaintance,
Professor Heine.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:59.680
I am Ernst Rosenberg,
Crown Prince Eins' high steward.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.020
This man is...

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:10.550
I spoke of Prince Bruno to an acquaintance
of mine. A certain university professor.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:15.550
He took an interest in the prince and came
all the way from Orosz to meet him tonight.

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:17.540
And that is why he returned at this hour?

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:23.970
Yes. I should be returning to Prince
Eins' residence at this hour, myself.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.050
Excuse me.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:38.620
How would you feel about leaving Glanzreich
and studying to be a scholar with me?

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.050
What?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.280
There can only be one king, yes?

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:47.440
Not that being a scholar is easy,
but it's at least more realistic.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:51.070
You could be a prominent scholar.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:55.170
You need to go out into the world
and broaden your horizons.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:58.130
Make your talents blossom out there.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:03.880
I'm flattered, but as a prince in the
Glanzreich royal family's line of succession...

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.460
But you're the third son,

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:09.430
and your eldest brother is an excellent
candidate for king, isn't he?

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:13.590
The probability that you could become
king is, well, zero, isn't it?

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.440
The address of the hotel
where we're staying.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.860
We'll be leaving for Orosz one
week from now, in the evening.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:20.980
You should come with us.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.530
But this is too sudden.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.880
I'll be waiting for your "yes."

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.330
I know.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:31.170
I know that me becoming king is unrealistic.

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:32.910
But I still...

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.590
What am I to do?

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:38.630
Father!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.490
How was my report?

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:45.200
It had many misspellings and errors,
but it was very well done.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:49.590
You have a very flexible imagination.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.260
I think that is a most appealing talent.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.880
Keep at it.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:58.190
Y-Yes, Father! Thank you!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:03.900
It's been one week.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:10.540
Perhaps the fresh air will calm my heart
and bring things into perspective.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:14.860
Master!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.160
Ah, Prince Bruno.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:20.910
I was walking Shadow.
Doggies are adorable, yes?

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:23.990
It looked to me as though you
were the one being walked...

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:24.580
What?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.910
Ahem. Nothing.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.840
You've been distracted again, Prince Bruno.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.990
Is there something on your mind?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:36.640
W-Well... No, this is something
I must decide for myself.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.660
That holds true for most worries.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:44.440
However, speaking to others can sometimes
help you sort through your thoughts.

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:49.410
I may not be able to offer much advice,
but I will listen, if you wish.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.690
Well... the truth is...

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:54.520
I am unsure if I should pursue the throne...

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.520
Oh? A scholar? A splendid idea.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:58.740
Nonchalant...

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.620
Studying under a university professor
would be a great opportunity.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.770
B-But you are teaching me to
groom me for the throne...

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:11.480
There is no reason for me to object
so long as it is good for you.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.420
Is that so?

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:18.160
So it is. Honestly, I also think
that I should become a scholar.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:22.800
I've studied for the throne
because I look up to Father.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.100
But I wonder if it would be
better for the kingdom if my

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.060
distinguished eldest brother
became the next king.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.790
But you are distinguished as well.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:31.640
That's...!

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:35.770
That's because I wanted to be,
and acted in accordance.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.220
I'm no one that special.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:44.370
I've always held grudges and gotten
jealous of others. I just don't show it.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:50.660
I'm not even a good big brother.
I'm not worthy of Leonhard's respect.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:54.100
Prince Bruno.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.250
You need a lesson.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.750
Say you are on your deathbed.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:04.430
As your consciousness wavers, you may think
"I wish I had done that, back then."

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.380
But time will not turn back.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.470
You have only one life,
and it is yours alone.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.780
Do you need a reason to
live it as you please?

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.350
In short...

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.120
it depends only on your own resolve.

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:25.890
Whatever choice you make, I will be wishing
for your continued health. Good day.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.370
Wait!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.000
I think that you have helped
me sort through my thoughts.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.880
I am grateful, Master.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.640
Bruno!

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.640
Forgive me for keeping you waiting.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:47.170
So, you made up your mind?

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:51.190
Yes. I gave the matter serious
consideration every day.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.550
Dr. Dmitri...

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:57.310
Please take me to your university in Orosz!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.880
I see! Then—

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:01.530
But...

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.030
As a friend, in the future.

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:05.890
Huh?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.630
What's this?

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:12.590
Copies of all the papers
I've written thus far.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:15.330
Please take a look at them if you have time.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.840
The next time you are in Glanzreich,

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:23.350
I would be pleased if you would visit
the palace and have a dialogue with me.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.340
So you really do want to be king.

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:32.350
Yes. It's been my dream from a young age.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.300
Hmph. Sophistry.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:38.870
Now, now. By the by, what will
you do if you don't become king?

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:41.730
It will be difficult to
change paths later in life.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.160
I'm well aware.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.390
In short, it depends on my own resolve.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:53.240
I made this choice. If defeat and
disappointment await me, I will overcome them.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:57.530
I am not the father I look up to,
or my talented brother.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.920
Because I have known setbacks myself,

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.340
I too could be useful to
our suffering people.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.350
With those feelings in this heart,

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:10.060
I will grasp the throne with the hard
work I have always believed in.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:13.400
That is my resolve to chase my dreams.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.140
I see. If you feel this strongly
about it, I guess that's that.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.310
Although we would have liked to
work with you. Isn't that right?

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:21.770
Huh?

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:27.360
He has a sharp tongue, but Smerdyakov here
is a fan of yours. He reads your papers.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.480
D-Doctor!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.780
Come to Orosz someday. We'll take you
to a place with the best borscht.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:33.540
I will.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:40.540
Ah, yes, about your presentation.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.590
The content was excellent,

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.030
but I think the standing ovation also came

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.060
from the audience seeing how
wise you are for a royal.

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:52.880
They might expect more
from you than you think.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:56.660
Let me brag about having you
as a friend one of these days.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.400
Yes, sir. I was honored by your invitation.

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:01.940
Thank you!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.770
We'll have a nice, relaxed chat next time.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.450
Master! What are you doing here?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.530
I thought I would guard you
from any dangers on the road.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.410
D-Did you hear my conversation
with Dr. Dmitri?

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:26.420
Indeed I did, though I did
not mean to eavesdrop.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.960
How embarrassing.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:34.180
However, it impressed the sincerity
of your resolve upon me.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:39.230
Let us work together to make you a
worthy candidate for the throne.

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:45.980
Yes, Master!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:47.790
I will follow you for my entire life!

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.550
Not for your entire life.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:52.990
Is that so?

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:56.130
Prince Bruno did not give
up on the throne, either?

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:00.000
Perhaps we should move to eliminate <i>him</i>.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:03.630
The royal tutor, Heine Wittgenstein.

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:07.300
Bring me a full report on his origins.

00:23:39.260 --> 00:23:42.140
Like, Bruni, why are you
always so stern with me?

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:44.190
Because you are always
so slovenly, obviously.

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:44.020
Smack Smack

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:45.900
Be more aware of your royal station!

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:47.230
Oh great, another lecture.

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:49.240
Next time, "A Timid Heart"!

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:53.770
Next Time:

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:53.770
A Timid Heart

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:51.020
You aren't going to eat that apple pie?

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.700
Gloom

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:51.830
Don't mind if I do!

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:54.130
Did I not just tell you...?!
